SUMMARY:Interest List: Mindful Speed Dating Event 35-54
DESCRIPTION:Mindful Meet & Mingle – Asheville Singles\nThis is an applic
 ation-based event.\nRSVP on Meetup does not guarantee a spot.\nParticipati
 on requires completing a short interest form and receiving a private regis
 tration link. This is paid event. Please do not make travel plans or assum
 e attendance until you receive a confirmation email.\n\nhttps://forms.gle/
 RFrKuEAmrL8ApDUAA\n\nAbout Event\nMeet in the Moment is a guided\, speed-d
 ating style experience for conscious singles who want to slow down\, drop 
 out of small talk\, and connect with presence and authenticity.\nThis is n
 ot traditional speed dating. There is no pressure to perform\, impress\, o
 r decide anything in the moment. Instead\, you’ll be gently guided into 
 embodied connection through simple mindfulness prompts\, structured one-on
 -one conversations\, and moments of reflection.\nThe intention is to help 
 you feel grounded\, relaxed\, and real while meeting others who value emot
 ional availability\, curiosity\, and meaningful connection.\n\nWhat to Exp
 ect\n\n* A short opening grounding practice to help you arrive and settle\
 n* A series of timed\, one-on-one conversations with gentle prompts\n* Cle
 ar structure so you can relax and be yourself\n* Space to reflect and noti
 ce how connection feels in your body\n* A warm\, inclusive\, and respectfu
 l environment\n\nYou do not need dating experience\, meditation experience
 \, or confidence in small talk. Just come as you are.\n\nWho is this for\n
 \n* Singles who want deeper connection\, not surface-level chatting\n* Peo
 ple who value mindfulness\, emotional awareness\, and authenticity\n* Thos
 e curious about meeting others in a slower\, more intentional way\n* Anyon
 e feeling tired of dating apps or conventional speed dating\n\nImportant N
 otes\n\n* This event is designed for people who are emotionally available 
 and open to respectful connection\n* You will never be asked to share anyt
 hing you’re uncomfortable sharing\n* Attraction is welcome\, but there i
 s no expectation to match or follow up\n\nTicketing & Balance\n\nTo suppor
 t a balanced experience\, tickets are offered by gender and capped to keep
  numbers even. If one ticket type sells out\, you may join the waitlist.\n
 \nWe run the event **every other month** with alternating age ranges: 35
 –54 and 55–74. Choose the session that aligns with your life stage.
